### Get all announcements (default: page 1, newest first)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements

### Get announcements - page 2
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements?page=2

### Search by title
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements?search=laptop

### Sort by oldest first
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements?sort=oldest

### Search + pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements?search=sale&page=1

### Search + sort + pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements?search=asus&sort=oldest&page=1

### Empty search (should return all)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements?search=

### Invalid page (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements?page=0

### Get announcement by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements/1

### Get announcement by ID (not found)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements/9999

### Get announcement by ID (invalid id)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/announcements/abc